      <h1>China Lead-Acid Battery Manufacturers</h1>
      <p class="muted">Battery Manufacturer Directory · Last reviewed 2026-09-15</p>

      <div class="box">
        <strong>Direct answer:</strong> China is the world's largest lead-acid battery producer, and the leading
        manufacturers are concentrated in the automotive SLI and e-bike segments. The major names — <strong>Camel</strong>
        (骆驼), <strong>Fengfan</strong> (风帆), <strong>Tianneng</strong> (天能) and <strong>Chaowei</strong> (超威) — are
        large, listed or near-listed companies. Below them sits a long tail of smaller, regionally strong producers.
      </div>

      <h2>Major manufacturers</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Company</th><th>Chinese name</th><th>Base</th><th>Segment</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Camel Group</td><td>骆驼集团</td><td>Xiangyang, Hubei</td><td>Automotive SLI / AGM</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Fengfan</td><td>风帆</td><td>Baoding, Hebei</td><td>Automotive SLI</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Tianneng Power</td><td>天能动力</td><td>Changxing, Zhejiang</td><td>Automotive + e-bike</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Chaowei Power</td><td>超威动力</td><td>Changxing, Zhejiang</td><td>Automotive + e-bike</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
